R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEUAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==' data-src='/webfolders/NEWS/newsContent/13584_RSCCneed_square.jpg' alt=''><span class='titleContainer'><span class='firstTitle'>What do you need to succeed? Let us know!</span><span class='secondTitle' aria-hidden='true' >What do you need to succeed? Let us know!<span class='linkAction accTextLight'>Continue reading &ndash;</span></span></span></a></li><li class='unpinned'><a class='hasImage' href='/?14411-News-Roane-State-receives-13M-in-grants-from-Appalachian-Regional-Commissions-POWER-Initiative'><img src='data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEUAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==' data-src='/webfolders/NEWS/newsContent/14411_ARCpowergrant_square.png' alt=''><span class='titleContainer'><span class='firstTitle'>Roane State receives $1.3M in grants from Appalachian Regional Commission’s POWER Initiative</span><span class='secondTitle' aria-hidden='true' >Roane State receives $1.3M in grants from Appalachian Regional Commission’s POWER Initiative<span class='linkAction accTextLight'>Continue reading &ndash;</span></span></span></a></li>
